{"product_id":"napoleon-alan-forrest","title":"Napoleon (Alan Forrest)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"478\"\u003eNapoleon. A name that still echoes across history like the roll of a battlefield drum. Conqueror, emperor, exile, and legend—Napoleon Bonaparte is as much myth as man. But who was he really? Alan Forrest takes us beyond the propaganda and the marble statues to uncover the restless energy, ambition, and contradictions of the man who reshaped Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"812\"\u003eThis isn’t just a timeline of battles and treaties. Forrest paints Napoleon as a human being: brilliant and flawed, charismatic and ruthless, adored and despised. From his meteoric rise in revolutionary France to his lonely end on Saint Helena, you’ll follow a story that is as gripping as any novel—only it all actually happened.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"1125\"\u003eWhether you’re a history buff, a casual reader curious about the man behind the bicorne hat, or someone who loves a tale of power, ambition, and downfall, \u003cem data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"979\"\u003eNapoleon\u003c\/em\u003e is a compact but powerful portrait that strips away the myths and gets to the heart of why this figure still fascinates us two centuries later.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1249\"\u003eProduct Details\u003cbr data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1145\"\u003eDimensions: 129 x 198 mm\u003cbr data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1172\"\u003eAuthor: Alan Forrest\u003cbr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1195\"\u003eISBN: 9780199663257\u003cbr data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1217\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1237\"\u003ePages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45704441004185,"sku":"15RB-5 9780199663257","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/61jm-THly9L.jpg?v=1757412791","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/napoleon-alan-forrest","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}